Subject: Cantor Phase3 Topology Scanner Formation Plan

& [PlanIdentity] is a dependency-ordered M2 program
  + [plan_uuid] is 36090692-48c8-460a-8584-e803f4a5ef28
  + [status] is formed

& [M2A] is pure topology forms
  + [deliver] ScanRequest, ScanLimits, EntryObservation, StreamFact, StrongFileIdentity, TopologyReceipt, TopologyFault, and validation
  + [proof] closed JSON, canonical values, exhaustive faults, receipt mismatch, expiry, and reuse semantics
  + [prohibition] no filesystem, platform, clock, random, process, network, model, unsafe, or new dependency

& [M2B] is Windows seam activation review
  + [pin] minimum supported Windows version and filesystem set
  + [dependency] exact windows-sys version, features, lockfile delta, license, advisory result, and transitive count
  + [ABI] exact functions, structures, constants, access masks, share masks, dispositions, and flags
  + [unsafe] one invariant table per call and owned-handle destructor
  + [mask] exact admitted and rejected attribute bits
  + [output] new source selection and implementation signature or rejection

& [M2C] is read-only implementation
  + [adapter] private Windows-only generated calls
  + [scanner] safe deterministic traversal and hashing
  + [faults] no suppressed OS or platform uncertainty
  + [unit] pure policy fixtures without adversarial filesystem creation
  + [compile] non-Windows build behavior is explicit unsupported, not accidental breakage

& [M2D] is disposable physical proof
  + [root] one exact disposable fixture root resolved and asserted before any change
  + [fixtures] implement T-01 through T-14 only
  + [cleanup] recoverable and separately verified
  + [evidence] signed fixture manifest, outcomes, environment facts, and no-outside-effect canaries

& [M2E] is mutation-pipeline integration
  + [predecessor] revalidate exact Phase3A receipt
  + [scan] issue one fresh TopologyReceipt
  + [consume] bind once into MutationWorkPacket
  + [launch] remains blocked until independent sandbox proof S-01 through S-12 is also complete

& [StopRules] are fail closed
  + [unsupported_API] stop before M2C
  + [dependency_risk] stop before M2C
  + [identity_ambiguity] stop before admission
  + [fixture_scope_uncertain] stop before M2D
  + [sandbox_canary_failure] quarantine and do not launch
